  - Id: station.st_peters.green_d
    Position: {x: 5.136877, y: 7.941742}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -119.05725
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: green
    Why: "standing on the green, place 4 of 4 \u2014 the ground between the hearth
      and the spawn, where the life is"
  - Id: station.st_peters.ginny_village_mark
    Position: {x: 4, y: 11}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 180
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: yard_cottage
    Why: "Ginny's mark in the village \u2014 the spot the opening's first conversation
      happens on, and where she is through the working day now that she lives out
      on her plot"
  - Id: station.st_peters.cottage_step
    Position: {x: 76.73723, y: 26.12861}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -111.84395
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: yard_ginny_plot
    Why: "Ginny's own step, out on her plot in the eastern woods \u2014 turned to
      look back down the way you walk up from the village"
  - Id: station.st_peters.cottage_garden
    Position: {x: 84, y: 21}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 0
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: yard_ginny_plot
    Why: "the garden on the cottage's south side \u2014 the sunny flank, and the
