    Position: {x: -55, y: 2.5}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 270
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: flats_head
    Why: "the head of the flats, a few strides off the wet bucket \u2014 where a
      man who digs for a living stands, looking west out over the bar (#354's own
      spot, unmoved)"
  - Id: station.st_peters.flats_lookout
    Position: {x: -52.009144, y: 2.734067}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 270
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: flats_head
    Why: "a few strides inland of the digging, looking west \u2014 the sun goes down
      over the bar, and this is the only place on the island you can watch it do
      that"
  - Id: station.st_peters.slip_head
    Position: {x: 190, y: 0}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 82.40455
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: slip_head
    Why: "the shoreward end of the slip, on the planks \u2014 where a boat's line
      gets taken"
  - Id: station.st_peters.wharf_head
    Position: {x: 207.5, y: 1.5}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 90
    Interior: {fileID: 0}
    LaneNodeName: wharf_head
    Why: "up the wharf from the slip head, watching the water (#354's own spot, unmoved)
      \u2014 the dock is the east end, so this is who is there when you come home
      under power"
  - Id: station.st_peters.home_saltbox
    Position: {x: 21.86, y: 8}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 90
    Interior: {fileID: 301495738}
    LaneNodeName: yard_saltbox
    Why: "the saltbox's keeping room \u2014 Rose's"
  - Id: station.st_peters.home_farmhouse
    Position: {x: 18.334208, y: 24.286463}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 44.999985
    Interior: {fileID: 2088684901}
    LaneNodeName: lane_farmhouse
    Why: "the farmhouse hall \u2014 the biggest floor on the island, and the only
      one that seats four"
  - Id: station.st_peters.home_sage_a
    Position: {x: 10.6, y: -18.184126}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 153.43494
    Interior: {fileID: 2138107671}
    LaneNodeName: yard_sage_cottage
    Why: "the fisherman's cottage, one side of the doorway lane \u2014 Junior's"
  - Id: station.st_peters.home_sage_b
    Position: {x: 9.400001, y: -18.184126}
    StandHeadingDegrees: -153.43497
    Interior: {fileID: 2138107671}
    LaneNodeName: yard_sage_cottage
    Why: "the same cottage, the other side \u2014 Basil's. Two men of the water under
      one roof, and two people leaving one door at dawn is a thing you can watch
      happen"
  - Id: station.st_peters.home_store
    Position: {x: 3.9999998, y: 28.557407}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 0.000011383649
    Interior: {fileID: 951163945}
    LaneNodeName: lane_store
    Why: "the store's own floor \u2014 the storekeeper lives over her shop, which
      is why the shop is dark at night by the same data that draws her asleep"
  - Id: station.st_peters.school_desk
    Position: {x: -12, y: 31.31911}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 0
    Interior: {fileID: 1945209893}
    LaneNodeName: lane_school
    Why: "the schoolroom \u2014 the teacher's desk at the stove end, facing back
      down the room"
  - Id: station.st_peters.post_office_counter
    Position: {x: 16.68, y: 41.039497}
    StandHeadingDegrees: 0
    Interior: {fileID: 193787021}
    LaneNodeName: lane_post_office
    Why: "behind the post office counter. \u26A0\uFE0F Its street door is on the
      OPPOSITE wall to a house's and 1.68 m off its centre, both MEASURED \u2014
      see InsideStandPoint"
